Subject: [PATCH] Fix sidebar order, change points cycle to 4 weeks, add
 Sergeant Promotions tab

- Fix Promotions nav item rendering below Damage Calculator instead of right after Divisions
- Recent points now resets every 4 weeks instead of 2, still anchored to Friday 2026-09-18
- New HR Panel sub-tab: Sergeant Promotions, listing Corporals who have reached 40+ recent points
  - Tracked in a new sergeant_promotion_candidates table so it persists across recent-points resets
